{"ref":"BDB, צִיר⁴","hw":"צִיר⁴","html":"† IV. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>pang (</strong>proposes <em>writhing</em><strong>)</strong>;—pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִירִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.8\">Is 13:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.3\">21:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִירֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.3\">21:3</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִירַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:16\" href=\"/Daniel.10.16\">Dn 10:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.19\">1 S 4:19</a>;—<em>pangs</em> of childbirth <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.19\">1 S 4:19</a>, so (sim.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.3\">Is 21:3</a>; and, of terror, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.8\">13:8</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבָלִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.3\">21:3</a>; in gen., of physical effects of mental distress <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:16\" href=\"/Daniel.10.16\">Dn 10:16</a>.","next":"BDB, צֵל","prev":"BDB, צִיר³"}